    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d300">

                <pb facs="0372" n="304" sameAs="frus:frus1867p1/pg304"/>

                <head>Mr. Dix to Mr. Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 100.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Paris,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-06-28"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 28, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to transmit herewith á
                    translation of a communication received from the Marquis de Moustier, minister
                    of foreign affairs, in relation to the appointment of Mr. Samuel B. Ruggles as a
                    delegate to the international conference now holding its sessions in Paris.</p>
                <p>I am, with great respect, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JOHN A. DIX.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D. C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
